<h1>J.J. McCarthy Traded: <em>From No. 10 Pick to a Fifth-Rounder</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 5 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🔄 Giants · Trade</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">The Vikings traded J.J. McCarthy to the Giants for a 2027 fifth-round pick — a stunning fall for a player Minnesota traded up to select 10th overall just two years ago. He lands in New York as Jameis Winston's backup, behind a Giants offense that just lost starter Jaxson Dart for the season.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
