</div>
<h2 id="trade">The Trade</h2>
<p>Minnesota sent McCarthy to New York for a 2027 fifth-round pick, a stunning return for a player who was the No. 10 overall selection just two draft cycles ago. The move clears roughly $4.5 million off Minnesota's books and comes after the Vikings named free-agent addition Kyler Murray their starter over McCarthy in August — a decision that effectively ended McCarthy's time in Minnesota before it ever really began.</p>
<div class="stat-card">
<div class="stat-icon">🔄</div>
<div class="stat-title">J.J. McCarthy — Trade Details</div>
<div class="stat-sub">Minnesota Vikings → New York Giants</div>
<div class="stat-numbers">
<div class="stat-num"><div class="num">Rd 5</div><div class="label">2027 Pick, Return</div></div>
